    ("ccma-diabetes", "Type 1 diabetes is characterized by:", "Autoimmune destruction of pancreatic beta cells with absolute insulin deficiency", ("Primary insulin resistance only", "Reversible gestational hormones only", "Exclusively diet-induced always"), "Type 1 requires insulin for survival.", (S.NHA_CCMA, S.ADA_STANDARDS,)),
